    {
      "id": 2,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Thanks for asking! It's been pretty busy lately. I was actually just looking at my calendar and seeing if there's any more of your stuff available. If you have any other stuff in mind though, feel free to drop me a line!",
      "created_at": "2026-10-03T06:42:07.584079+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Yeah, I'm not sure if it would be too much to ask.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-03T06:42:49.068684+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, I'm sorry. That would be a lot of trouble for my parents to organize. Would you like me to check on their schedules and let them know?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-03T06:44:42.331020+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Sure, let me know what they said.",
