    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Really? That's awesome. How about it at 3 PM?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-03T06:55:45.574509+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Thank you for asking! It's been quite the busy month for me. I was just looking at my calendar and saw there wasn't much more of your stuff available. If you have any other stuff in mind though, feel free to drop me a line.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-03T06:57:35.573009+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Thanks! So you don't have more stuff to give?",
